      <title>JNode</title>
      <subtitle></subtitle>
      <track>Free Java</track>
      <type></type>
      <language></language>
      <abstract>&#xA;&lt;p&gt;This talk will give an overview of &lt;a href=&#34;http://www.jnode.org/&#34;&gt;JNode&lt;/a&gt; and its current state.&#xA;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;  </abstract>
      <description>&#xA;&lt;p&gt;JNode is an operating system based on Java technology. The overview of architecture, OpenJDK integration, progress during last year, current state and future directions will be covered, including a demo of the system.&#xA;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;  </description>
